# Multi-request file with different response formats and status codes: each response tab shows its own
# status (200 / 404 / 500 …) and format (JSON, XML, HTML, text). Use Send All, then switch between the tabs.

### JSON response
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/json

### XML response
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/xml

### HTML response
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/html

### Plain text (robots.txt)
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/robots.txt

### Send XML body
POST {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/post
Content-Type: application/xml

<order id="7">
  <item sku="A1">Book</item>
  <total currency="IDR">150000</total>
</order>

### Not found (404)
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/status/404

### Server error (500)
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/status/500

### Slow response (2 s)
GET {{HTTPBIN_URL}}/delay/2
